            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">Now the refund queue's own job reads that table. Whoever maintains it\ndoesn't have to trust your word, or re-check your data: its\npreconditions are discharged from the table's schema and constraints,\nwhich the contract put there:</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
